            "value" : "Premošćenja: CMUX_SOCKET_ENABLE, CMUX_SOCKET_MODE i CMUX_SOCKET_PATH (postavite CMUX_ALLOW_SOCKET_OVERRIDE=1 za stabilne/nightly verzije)."
          }
